{"id":"60cf9e66e1dc462c","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-external-redex-needed.md","title":"外部红项最外且必需","display":"thm-external-redex-needed — 外部红项最外且必需","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-external-redex-needed","aliases":["56-thm-external-redex-needed"],"display":"thm-external-redex-needed — 外部红项最外且必需","depends_on":["[[56-thm-external-redex-persistence]]","[[56-df-needed-redex]]"],"source_section":"§9.2 Examples 9.2.32(ii)","source_printed_pages":"497","source_ocr_blocks":[518],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"direct-residual-proof-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-external-redex-needed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-external-redex-needed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-external-redex-needed — 外部红项最外且必需"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3929f56790d04f90\" href=\"?note=3929f56790d04f90\" title=\"56-thm-external-redex-persistence\">56-thm-external-redex-persistence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1db927c3e4a86c94\" href=\"?note=1db927c3e4a86c94\" title=\"56-df-needed-redex\">56-df-needed-redex</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Examples 9.2.32(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"497"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>518</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"direct-residual-proof-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3929f56790d04f90\" href=\"?note=3929f56790d04f90\" title=\"56-thm-external-redex-persistence\">56-thm-external-redex-persistence</a> 的正交系统及外部性、残余与最外位置接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\">\\(\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1db927c3e4a86c94\" href=\"?note=1db927c3e4a86c94\" title=\"56-df-needed-redex\">56-df-needed-redex</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式在外部性中取零步路径即得。对第二式，任取正规形路径；若从不收缩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的残余，则逐步应用外部持久定理，终点仍有残余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，与正规形无红项矛盾。因此该路径必收缩某个残余。对全部正规形路径量化即为needed。此证明不借用needed正规化或外部红项存在性，也不声称每个最外needed红项都外部。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-external-redex-persistence","status":"resolved","id":"3929f56790d04f90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-external-redex-persistence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-needed-redex","status":"resolved","id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-needed-redex]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-external-redex-persistence","status":"resolved","id":"3929f56790d04f90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-thm-external-redex-persistence]] 的正交系统及外部性、残余与最外位置接口；$s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$，$\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)$。$\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)$ 见 [[56-df-needed-redex]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-needed-redex","status":"resolved","id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-thm-external-redex-persistence]] 的正交系统及外部性、残余与最外位置接口；$s\\in T$、$u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$，$\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)$。$\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)$ 见 [[56-df-needed-redex]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{External}_R(s,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,V,R,s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u).","display":true},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false}],"bytes":1409,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-external-redex-needed.md]]"}],"outgoing":["3929f56790d04f90","1db927c3e4a86c94"]}